<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Role permissions were {{action}}
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Access update
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Permissions for one of the roles on your Dukka staff account were <strong>{{action}}</strong>. This can expand, reduce, or refine what you can do in the portal.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Role id" value=roleId}}
  {{> detail-row label="Action" value=action}}
{{/details}}

{{#if permissionNames}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Permissions
</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px;color:#2a2a2a;">
  {{#each permissionNames}}
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">{{this}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>
{{/if}}

{{#if permissionIds}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Permission ids
</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px;color:#2a2a2a;">
  {{#each permissionIds}}
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">{{this}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>
{{/if}}

{{#> tip title="Refresh your session"}}
  Sign out and back in if permissions do not appear updated immediately. Reach out to an administrator if something looks incorrect.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Your access should now match the latest role configuration.
</p>
